      "day": 1,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "💧 A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm returns with water: +4 clean."
