    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm heads out to forage. \"Out for a forage. If I'm late, start without me.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "📋 A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm — 🪾 Gather deadfall. They'll report back by next part."
