      "line": "...and then it lands: A woman, maybe 30s, with a burn-scarred forearm speaks 🇯🇵 Japanese. You share no language at all."
    },
    {
      "day": 15,
      "line": "🛡️ Werner, Patrick, Ingrid and Yuki met them at the door — 4 put down. Werner, Patrick, Ingrid, Yuki are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 23,
      "line": "🛡️ Werner, Patrick, Sigrun and Ingrid met them at the door — 3 put down, 1 driven off. Werner, Patrick, Sigrun, Ingrid are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 32,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Boris just put down The Focus Group... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
