    },
    {
      "day": 47,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Catalina just put down The Loud Beast... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 47,
      "line": "🛡️ Patrick, Ingrid and Catalina met them at the door — 2 put down, 1 barely walked away. Patrick, Ingrid are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 49,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
